{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Bodega Simulator is a short simulation game where you play as a recently laid off adventurer running a small shop. Grow and make supplies to sell, raise slimes as pets, and see if you can save up enough for One Last Gig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/7966868b31f7aaaa70efa56886676d47.avif?t=1759349087\" alt=\"Game Features\" width=1400 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops and process them into items for adventurers!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell items to a variety of returning customers, dungeon creatures, and former co-workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle with different demands each day you can adapt to and make more gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what you want to upgrade to optimize your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and breed slimes to unlock special items you can sell to customers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your character get over their imposter syndrome and work up the courage to get back into adventuring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Style graphics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458180?t=1759349087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458180?t=1759349087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/ef66f111148bde94ca69a43ba44748beafc34eae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759349087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/ef66f111148bde94ca69a43ba44748beafc34eae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759349087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full con